<VillagerDialog xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="https://vezel.dev/novadrop/dc/VillagerDialog VillagerDialog.xsd" id="10500" huntingZoneId="2501" voiceTypeId="0" xmlns="https://vezel.dev/novadrop/dc/VillagerDialog">
    <Text id="110" endSocial="0">
        <Page social="0" voiceTypeId="0">[EN] Well look who&amp;#8217;s there.&lt;BR&gt;If it isn't clever, clever Lok.&lt;br&gt;[ES] Vaya, miren qui&amp;#233;n est&amp;#225; ah&amp;#237;.&lt;BR&gt;Si no es el listo, listo Lok.</Page>
    </Text>
    <Text id="111" endSocial="0">
        <Page social="0" voiceTypeId="0">[EN] You cursed worms...&lt;br&gt;[ES] Malditos gusanos...</Page>
    </Text>
    <Text id="112" endSocial="0">
        <Page social="0" voiceTypeId="0">[EN] I will destroy you all.&lt;br&gt;[ES] Los destruir&amp;#233; a todos.</Page>
    </Text>
    <Text id="113" endSocial="0">
        <Page social="0" voiceTypeId="0">[EN] Ha!&lt;br&gt;[ES] &amp;#161;Ja!</Page>
    </Text>
    <Text id="114" endSocial="0">
        <Page social="0" voiceTypeId="0">[EN] Hmph, not bad.&lt;br&gt;[ES] Mmm, nada mal.</Page>
    </Text>
    <Text id="120" endSocial="0">
        <Page social="0" voiceTypeId="0">[EN] I want to rip you apart right now,&lt;br&gt;[ES] Quiero destrozarte ahora mismo,</Page>
    </Text>
    <Text id="121" endSocial="0">
        <Page social="0" voiceTypeId="0">[EN] But I guess gaining more power should come before everything else.&lt;br&gt;[ES] pero supongo que conseguir m&amp;#225;s poder debe estar por encima de todo lo dem&amp;#225;s.</Page>
    </Text>
    <Text id="122" endSocial="0">
        <Page social="0" voiceTypeId="0">[EN] I&amp;#8217;m leaving one more gift for you.&lt;br&gt;[ES] Te dejar&amp;#233; un regalo m&amp;#225;s.</Page>
    </Text>
</VillagerDialog>
